#
# Same rationale as the folders above: the folder mixes text (CSV deformation /
# region / weight tables, markdown reports, run logs) with PNG renders, so
# `-text` switches end-of-line conversion off in both directions. This keeps the
# measured numbers byte-identical for a reviewer who re-runs the comparison on
# Linux or macOS, and keeps the PNG bytes untouched. Scope is limited to this
# new folder; no pre-existing file changes its checkout behaviour.
docs/phases/P1-visual-recovery/wp4-host-rig-01/** -text

# VR-1B master-plan phase plans + WP3-R2 evidence folder (2026-11-28).
#
# Same rationale: the folder mixes text (CSV solve-case / profile tables,
# markdown plans/reports, run logs, saveable profiles) with PNG renders, so
# `-text` switches end-of-line conversion off in both directions to keep the
# measured numbers and profile hashes byte-identical across platforms. Scope is
# limited to this new folder; no pre-existing file changes its checkout behaviour.
docs/phases/VR-1B/** -text
